0..56 Comment "//! Law 4 cancels a weakening and a single substitution."
57..60 Comment "//!"
61..104 Comment "//! `sub(sub(b, p), single(a))` equals `b`."
105..108 Comment "//!"
109..184 Comment "//! The law does not hold by direct computation. An induction on `b` proves"
185..261 Comment "//! the law. `substSquare` and `substId` prove the required index agreement."
262..265 Comment "//!"
266..281 Comment "//! - see: #640"
